    "declaration_note": "Both modules also carry `OpExecutionMode ... LocalSize 1 1 1`. Where a `WorkgroupSize`-decorated constant is present the SPIR-V specification says it supersedes that execution mode, so the two are not in conflict; both are declarations of the geometry and neither is an instruction that reads it."
