  "what_this_cannot_show": "The driver's final machine code. NVIDIA compiles SPIR-V to SASS inside vkCreateComputePipelines with SpecId 0 already resolved to 1, and no SPIR-V tool observes that output. Module-level identity is evidence about the INPUT to the driver's compiler; register allocation, scheduling and instruction selection downstream of it are not observable here and are not claimed either way. VK_KHR_pipeline_executable_properties is the instrument that would answer it and this repository does not have one."
